            <h2 id="infodengue-title">Infodengue</h2>
            <p>An open-source project monitoring mosquito-borne diseases in Brazil.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://info.dengue.mat.br/"
              >Explore Infodengue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="about-lead">Data visualization, web development, and DevOps.</p>
            <p>
              Our team contributed to Infodengue through work on data
              visualization, its web platform, and development and deployment
              infrastructure. The collaboration began at OSL; some contributors
              were later contracted directly by the project.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
