            <h2 id="literev-title">LiteRev</h2>
            <p>
              A tool for finding and reviewing scientific literature, connected
              to The GRAPH Network and research at the University of Geneva.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://literev.unige.ch/"
              >Explore LiteRev <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="about-lead">Technical leadership across the research software stack.</p>
            <p>
              In a team formed at OSL, we contributed technical leadership
              and development across LiteRev’s data workflows, application,
              and infrastructure.
            </p>
            <ul class="capability-details">
              <li>AI, clustering, data processing, and benchmarking</li>
              <li>Background task orchestration with Celery and search with Elasticsearch</li>
              <li>Web development and DevOps</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
